# Values vtium does not support.
# References: ADR-1100 D14.
# spec: kitty graphics protocol (sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/graphics-protocol, read 2026-11-13), "Querying support for protocol features": "The terminal emulator will include in its reply every key from the feature query that has a non-default value which it supports for that action, with that value, as well as e itself"; ADR-1100 D14, "The answer"
# covers: image.kitty
size 20 10
send "\e_Ga=q,i=44,e=T,U=2,C=7,f=7,t=x\e\\"
